<title>USA: Motorola to begin sampling of RAM device.</title>
<headline>Motorola to begin sampling of RAM device.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said on Monday that it plans to have NetRAMs, fast static memory devices for the communications market, ready for sampling in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to begin production of the product in the second quarter of 1997. The NetRAMs are to be sold for $35.</p>
</text>
